{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "joining-fanout",
  "family": "fanout",
  "requirements": [
    "Protocol: each probe starts a fresh process; state persists only between its input lines. Read one JSON object per line and emit exactly one JSON object per line, with no other stdout. Object key order is immaterial; arrays are ordered. Inputs use exactly the documented keys; missing/extra keys, unknown operations, wrong types, null, booleans in integer positions and out-of-range values return {\"error\":\"invalid_input\"} without mutation, before any state-dependent checks. All quantities and logical times are integers; no wall clock, randomness, network or floating point is involved. Each followup applies independently to the base, never cumulatively. Followup rules override only the explicitly named base behavior.",
    "Start with three pending tasks amber, birch, cedar and total=0. status takes only op and returns {pending,total,done}, where pending is the lexicographically sorted array of unfinished names, total is the sum of accepted results, and done is true exactly when no tasks remain.",
    "complete takes op, task (one of amber/birch/cedar) and value (integer -100..100). A pending task is removed and its value added to total, returning status. A task already completed returns duplicate_task unchanged. Input validation precedes this check. Completion arrival order does not affect final total.",
    "fail takes exactly op and task (amber/birch/cedar). It settles that task with fallback value 0 and applies exactly the same duplicate and join rules as complete, returning status. A failed task counts as completed; repeated fail is equivalent to repeated complete with value 0."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "join": "Collection of exactly one result from each task.",
    "pending": "Task names whose result has not been accepted."
  },
  "probes": [
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--initial",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "pending": [
            "amber",
            "birch",
            "cedar"
          ],
          "total": 0,
          "done": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--out-of-order",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "cedar",
          "value": 4
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "amber",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "birch",
          "value": 3
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "pending": [
            "amber",
            "birch"
          ],
          "total": 4,
          "done": false
        },
        {
          "pending": [
            "birch"
          ],
          "total": 6,
          "done": false
        },
        {
          "pending": [],
          "total": 9,
          "done": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--duplicate",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "amber",
          "value": 5
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "amber",
          "value": 8
        },
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "pending": [
            "birch",
            "cedar"
          ],
          "total": 5,
          "done": false
        },
        {
          "error": "duplicate_task"
        },
        {
          "pending": [
            "birch",
            "cedar"
          ],
          "total": 5,
          "done": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--signed-results",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "birch",
          "value": -3
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "cedar",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "amber",
          "value": 3
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "pending": [
            "amber",
            "cedar"
          ],
          "total": -3,
          "done": false
        },
        {
          "pending": [
            "amber"
          ],
          "total": -3,
          "done": false
        },
        {
          "pending": [],
          "total": 0,
          "done": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--invalid",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "other",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "amber",
          "value": 101
        },
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "pending": [
            "amber",
            "birch",
            "cedar"
          ],
          "total": 0,
          "done": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--alternate-entrypath",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "fail",
          "task": "amber"
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "amber",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "op": "complete",
          "task": "birch",
          "value": 4
        },
        {
          "op": "fail",
          "task": "cedar"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "pending": [
            "birch",
            "cedar"
          ],
          "total": 0,
          "done": false
        },
        {
          "error": "duplicate_task"
        },
        {
          "pending": [
            "cedar"
          ],
          "total": 4,
          "done": false
        },
        {
          "pending": [],
          "total": 4,
          "done": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--protocol-rejections",
      "inputs": [
        {},
        {
          "op": "unknown"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "followups": [
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--idempotent-results",
      "requirements": [
        "An already completed task with the identical value returns current status without mutation. A repeat with a different value returns conflicting_result instead of duplicate_task."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "joining-fanout--idempotent-results--same",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "amber",
              "value": 6
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "amber",
              "value": 6
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "pending": [
                "birch",
                "cedar"
              ],
              "total": 6,
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "pending": [
                "birch",
                "cedar"
              ],
              "total": 6,
              "done": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "joining-fanout--idempotent-results--different",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "cedar",
              "value": -2
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "cedar",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "cedar",
              "value": -2
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "pending": [
                "amber",
                "birch"
              ],
              "total": -2,
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "error": "conflicting_result"
            },
            {
              "pending": [
                "amber",
                "birch"
              ],
              "total": -2,
              "done": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "joining-fanout--idempotent-results--alternate-entrypath",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "fail",
              "task": "birch"
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "birch",
              "value": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "birch",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "pending": [
                "amber",
                "cedar"
              ],
              "total": 0,
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "pending": [
                "amber",
                "cedar"
              ],
              "total": 0,
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "error": "conflicting_result"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "base_expected": {
        "joining-fanout--duplicate": [
          {
            "pending": [
              "birch",
              "cedar"
            ],
            "total": 5,
            "done": false
          },
          {
            "error": "conflicting_result"
          },
          {
            "pending": [
              "birch",
              "cedar"
            ],
            "total": 5,
            "done": false
          }
        ],
        "joining-fanout--alternate-entrypath": [
          {
            "pending": [
              "birch",
              "cedar"
            ],
            "total": 0,
            "done": false
          },
          {
            "error": "conflicting_result"
          },
          {
            "pending": [
              "cedar"
            ],
            "total": 4,
            "done": false
          },
          {
            "pending": [],
            "total": 4,
            "done": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "joining-fanout--quorum-two",
      "requirements": [
        "Join after any two distinct task completions: done is true when at least two results were accepted. pending still lists tasks without accepted results. After done, every valid complete returns join_closed before duplicate_task, without mutation."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "joining-fanout--quorum-two--early-close",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "birch",
              "value": 7
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "amber",
              "value": 8
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "cedar",
              "value": 9
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "pending": [
                "amber",
                "cedar"
              ],
              "total": 7,
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "pending": [
                "cedar"
              ],
              "total": 15,
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "error": "join_closed"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "joining-fanout--quorum-two--duplicate-not-quorum",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "cedar",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "cedar",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "amber",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "op": "complete",
              "task": "amber",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "pending": [
                "amber",
                "birch"
              ],
              "total": 1,
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "error": "duplicate_task"
            },
            {
              "pending": [
                "birch"
              ],
              "total": 3,
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "error": "join_closed"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "joining-fanout--quorum-two--alternate-entrypath",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "fail",
              "task": "amber"
            },
            {
              "op": "fail",
              "task": "cedar"
            },
            {
              "op": "fail",
              "task": "birch"
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "pending": [
                "birch",
                "cedar"
              ],
              "total": 0,
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "pending": [
                "birch"
              ],
              "total": 0,
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "error": "join_closed"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "base_expected": {
        "joining-fanout--out-of-order": [
          {
            "pending": [
              "amber",
              "birch"
            ],
            "total": 4,
            "done": false
          },
          {
            "pending": [
              "birch"
            ],
            "total": 6,
            "done": true
          },
          {
            "error": "join_closed"
          }
        ],
        "joining-fanout--signed-results": [
          {
            "pending": [
              "amber",
              "cedar"
            ],
            "total": -3,
            "done": false
          },
          {
            "pending": [
              "amber"
            ],
            "total": -3,
            "done": true
          },
          {
            "error": "join_closed"
          }
        ],
        "joining-fanout--alternate-entrypath": [
          {
            "pending": [
              "birch",
              "cedar"
            ],
            "total": 0,
            "done": false
          },
          {
            "error": "duplicate_task"
          },
          {
            "pending": [
              "cedar"
            ],
            "total": 4,
            "done": true
          },
          {
            "error": "join_closed"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
